owspan="1" colspan="1" valign="top">73.5 (3.09)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" valign="top">78.5 (3.25)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" valign="top">135.6 (3.13)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="char" char="." charoff="50" valign="top">103.2 (2.88)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" valign="top">115.9 (2.50)</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>